  "minute": 55.0,
  "event_seq": 108,
  "root_problem": "Billing dispute tickets roughly doubled from ~600/month to 1,180-1,260/month starting August 2026 (E-04). The majority of disputed bills (59%, 1,785 of 3,025, E-01) carry ACTUAL (not estimated) read types, indicating a billing calculation or tariff-application defect in the billing-import step is producing wrong bills on normally-read accounts — independent of any tariff rate change (ruled out, E-02) and independent of response-time capacity (already within SLA, E-03). A separate, smaller mechanism — field manual-read route completion falling to 88% against a 95% target (E-05) — plausibly drives estimate substitution for the remaining minority of disputed (ESTIMATED-read) bills."
 },
